        defendant: [.direct("Did you smash the truck?", "\"No. I was across town at a friend's house that night. I didn't touch {V.his} truck.\""), .direct("Who can say you were there?", "\"My friend and two others at his house. They'll say so.\""), .direct("Did you argue with {V} about parking?", "\"Yes, but I'd never smash a truck over a parking spot.\""), .direct("Whose bat was it?", "\"I don't know. I own a bat, but mine is in my closet at home.\""), .direct("What did you do when the deputy came?", "\"I told him where I was and gave him my friend's name.\""), .direct("What would you tell {V}?", "\"I'm sorry about your truck. It wasn't me, and I hope they find who did it.\""), .cross("You've been charged with damaging a vehicle before, haven't you?", "\"Yes, and I stood in this courtroom and said that I had learned my lesson. I wasn't there this time.\""), .cross("Your friends are not independent witnesses?", "\"They aren't independent witnesses, but they're honest, and they'll tell the truth.\""), .cross("A bat was found near your street?", "\"It was found near my street, and I can't explain how it got there.\""), .cross("You'll let the deputy see your bat?", "\"Yes, I'll let the deputy see my own bat, and look at it as closely as {OFF.he} likes.\""), .cross("You'll stay away from {V}'s truck?", "\"Yes, I'll stay away from {V}'s truck and from {V.his} house, completely.\"")],
