        openings: ("{D} applied to a staffing agency owned by {V} and presented two continuing-education certificates, and the training company said it never issued them, and this was not {DL}'s first time here, after {PRIOR} in {PRIORDATE}.", "The defense will say the certificates came from an online course, and {D} believed they were genuine. {D} did not forge any certificate."),
