        closings: ("The dock camera shows a person with a hammer at {V}'s boat, the two had argued over the shared slip, and after {PRIOR} {DL} understood exactly whose boat it was.", "An argument over a slip does not make {D} the person with the hammer, and {D} was offshore. The State must prove {D} smashed the boat."),
        timeline: [(-2, "The slip argument."), (0, "5 a.m.: the damage."), (0, "7 a.m.: {V} finds the boat.")],
        identified: "The dock camera.",
        mood: .indifferent)

